				<div class="text-left">
				   <div class="d-md-none h5 mb-3">By car</div>
				   <div class="mb-4 d-flex align-items-baseline">
					<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="car" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" class="mr-2 text-muted svg-inline--fa fa-car fa-w-16">
					 <path fill="currentColor" d="M499.99 176h-59.87l-16.64-41.6C406.38 91.63 365.57 64 319.5 64h-127c-46.06 0-86.88 27.63-103.99 70.4L71.87 176H12.01C4.2 176-1.53 183.34.37 190.91l6 24C7.7 220.25 12.5 224 18.01 224h20.07C24.65 235.73 16 252.78 16 272v48c0 16.12 6.16 30.67 16 41.93V416c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32h256v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-54.07c9.84-11.25 16-25.8 16-41.93v-48c0-19.22-8.65-36.27-22.07-48H494c5.51 0 10.31-3.75 11.64-9.09l6-24c1.89-7.57-3.84-14.91-11.65-14.91zm-352.06-17.83c7.29-18.22 24.94-30.17 44.57-30.17h127c19.63 0 37.28 11.95 44.57 30.17L384 208H128l19.93-49.83zM96 319.8c-19.2 0-32-12.76-32-31.9S76.8 256 96 256s48 28.71 48 47.85-28.8 15.95-48 15.95zm320 0c-19.2 0-48 3.19-48-15.95S396.8 256 416 256s32 12.76 32 31.9-12.8 31.9-32 31.9z" class=""></path>
					</svg>
					<div>
					 <div class="h5">From <strong>Milan, Florence or Bologna</strong> (north):</div>
					 A1, exit G.R.A (Rome's ring road) towards Flaminia, take the exit n.5 (Flaminia). Follow the indications for the stadium (Foro Italico).
					</div>
				   </div>
				   <div class="mb-4 d-flex align-items-baseline">
					<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="car" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" class="mr-2 text-muted svg-inline--fa fa-car fa-w-16">
					 <path fill="currentColor" d="M499.99 176h-59.87l-16.64-41.6C406.38 91.63 365.57 64 319.5 64h-127c-46.06 0-86.88 27.63-103.99 70.4L71.87 176H12.01C4.2 176-1.53 183.34.37 190.91l6 24C7.7 220.25 12.5 224 18.01 224h20.07C24.65 235.73 16 252.78 16 272v48c0 16.12 6.16 30.67 16 41.93V416c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32h256v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-54.07c9.84-11.25 16-25.8 16-41.93v-48c0-19.22-8.65-36.27-22.07-48H494c5.51 0 10.31-3.75 11.64-9.09l6-24c1.89-7.57-3.84-14.91-11.65-14.91zm-352.06-17.83c7.29-18.22 24.94-30.17 44.57-30.17h127c19.63 0 37.28 11.95 44.57 30.17L384 208H128l19.93-49.83zM96 319.8c-19.2 0-32-12.76-32-31.9S76.8 256 96 256s48 28.71 48 47.85-28.8 15.95-48 15.95zm320 0c-19.2 0-48 3.19-48-15.95S396.8 256 416 256s32 12.76 32 31.9-12.8 31.9-32 31.9z" class=""></path>
					</svg>
					<div>
					 <div class="h5">From <strong>Pescara or l’Aquila</strong> (east):</div>
					 A24, exit G.R.A (Rome's ring road) towards A1 Roma – Firenze. Take the exit n.5 (Flaminia) and follow the indications for the stadium (Foro Italico).
					</div>
				   </div>
				   <div class="mb-4 d-flex align-items-baseline">
					<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="car" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" class="mr-2 text-muted svg-inline--fa fa-car fa-w-16">
					 <path fill="currentColor" d="M499.99 176h-59.87l-16.64-41.6C406.38 91.63 365.57 64 319.5 64h-127c-46.06 0-86.88 27.63-103.99 70.4L71.87 176H12.01C4.2 176-1.53 183.34.37 190.91l6 24C7.7 220.25 12.5 224 18.01 224h20.07C24.65 235.73 16 252.78 16 272v48c0 16.12 6.16 30.67 16 41.93V416c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32h256v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-54.07c9.84-11.25 16-25.8 16-41.93v-48c0-19.22-8.65-36.27-22.07-48H494c5.51 0 10.31-3.75 11.64-9.09l6-24c1.89-7.57-3.84-14.91-11.65-14.91zm-352.06-17.83c7.29-18.22 24.94-30.17 44.57-30.17h127c19.63 0 37.28 11.95 44.57 30.17L384 208H128l19.93-49.83zM96 319.8c-19.2 0-32-12.76-32-31.9S76.8 256 96 256s48 28.71 48 47.85-28.8 15.95-48 15.95zm320 0c-19.2 0-48 3.19-48-15.95S396.8 256 416 256s32 12.76 32 31.9-12.8 31.9-32 31.9z" class=""></path>
					</svg>
					<div>
					 <div class="h5">From <strong>Naples</strong> (south):</div>
					 A2, exit G.R.A (Rome's ring road)  towards A1 Roma – Firenze. Take the exit n.5 (Flaminia) and follow the indications for the stadium (Foro Italico).
					</div>
				   </div>
				   <div class="mb-4 d-flex align-items-baseline">
					<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="car" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" class="mr-2 text-muted svg-inline--fa fa-car fa-w-16">
					 <path fill="currentColor" d="M499.99 176h-59.87l-16.64-41.6C406.38 91.63 365.57 64 319.5 64h-127c-46.06 0-86.88 27.63-103.99 70.4L71.87 176H12.01C4.2 176-1.53 183.34.37 190.91l6 24C7.7 220.25 12.5 224 18.01 224h20.07C24.65 235.73 16 252.78 16 272v48c0 16.12 6.16 30.67 16 41.93V416c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32h256v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-54.07c9.84-11.25 16-25.8 16-41.93v-48c0-19.22-8.65-36.27-22.07-48H494c5.51 0 10.31-3.75 11.64-9.09l6-24c1.89-7.57-3.84-14.91-11.65-14.91zm-352.06-17.83c7.29-18.22 24.94-30.17 44.57-30.17h127c19.63 0 37.28 11.95 44.57 30.17L384 208H128l19.93-49.83zM96 319.8c-19.2 0-32-12.76-32-31.9S76.8 256 96 256s48 28.71 48 47.85-28.8 15.95-48 15.95zm320 0c-19.2 0-48 3.19-48-15.95S396.8 256 416 256s32 12.76 32 31.9-12.8 31.9-32 31.9z" class=""></path>
					</svg>
					<div>
					 <div class="h5">From <strong>Fiumicino Leonardo Da Vinci airport:</strong></div>
					 Fiumicino motorway, exit G.R.A (Rome's ring road) towards Cassia-Flaminia, take the exit n.5 (Flaminia). Follow the indications for the stadium (Foro Italico)
					</div>
				   </div>
				   <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=stadio+olimpico+roma&amp;travelmode=driving" rel="noopener" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm">See driving directions from your location</a>
				</div>
			   </div>
			   <div role="tabpanel" aria-hidden="true" class="tab-pane fade card-body" id="__BVID__245" aria-labelledby="__BVID__245___BV_tab_button__" style="display: none;">
				<div class="text-left">
				   <div class="d-md-none h5 mb-3">By public transport</div>
				   <div class="mb-4 d-flex align-items-baseline">
					<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="train" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="mr-2 text-muted svg-inline--fa fa-train fa-w-14">
					 <path fill="currentColor" d="M448 96v256c0 51.815-61.624 96-130.022 96l62.98 49.721C386.905 502.417 383.562 512 376 512H72c-7.578 0-10.892-9.594-4.957-14.279L130.022 448C61.82 448 0 403.954 0 352V96C0 42.981 64 0 128 0h192c65 0 128 42.981 128 96zm-48 136V120c0-13.255-10.745-24-24-24H72c-13.255 0-24 10.745-24 24v112c0 13.255 10.745 24 24 24h304c13.255 0 24-10.745 24-24zm-176 64c-30.928 0-56 25.072-56 56s25.072 56 56 56 56-25.072 56-56-25.072-56-56-56z" class=""></path>
					</svg>
					<div>
					 <div class="h5">From <strong>Termini Train Station:</strong></div>
					 Metro line A to Battistini until Ottaviano, take the bus n. 32, get off at Piazzale della Farnesina, a few steps from the Olympic Stadium / Metro line A to Battistini until Flaminio, take the tram n. 2, get off at Piazza Mancini last stop, a few steps from the Stadio Olimpico.
					</div>
				   </div>
				   <div class="mb-4 d-flex align-items-baseline">
					<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="train" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="mr-2 text-muted svg-inline--fa fa-train fa-w-14">
					 <path fill="currentColor" d="M448 96v256c0 51.815-61.624 96-130.022 96l62.98 49.721C386.905 502.417 383.562 512 376 512H72c-7.578 0-10.892-9.594-4.957-14.279L130.022 448C61.82 448 0 403.954 0 352V96C0 42.981 64 0 128 0h192c65 0 128 42.981 128 96zm-48 136V120c0-13.255-10.745-24-24-24H72c-13.255 0-24 10.745-24 24v112c0 13.255 10.745 24 24 24h304c13.255 0 24-10.745 24-24zm-176 64c-30.928 0-56 25.072-56 56s25.072 56 56 56 56-25.072 56-56-25.072-56-56-56z" class=""></path>
					</svg>
					<div>
					 <div class="h5">From <strong>Tiburtina train station:</strong></div>
					 Metro line B to Laurentina until Termini, metro line A direction Battistini, get off at Ottaviano, take the bus n.32 until Piazzale della Farnesina.
					</div>
				   </div>
				   <div class="mb-4 d-flex align-items-baseline">
					<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="train" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="mr-2 text-muted svg-inline--fa fa-train fa-w-14">
					 <path fill="currentColor" d="M448 96v256c0 51.815-61.624 96-130.022 96l62.98 49.721C386.905 502.417 383.562 512 376 512H72c-7.578 0-10.892-9.594-4.957-14.279L130.022 448C61.82 448 0 403.954 0 352V96C0 42.981 64 0 128 0h192c65 0 128 42.981 128 96zm-48 136V120c0-13.255-10.745-24-24-24H72c-13.255 0-24 10.745-24 24v112c0 13.255 10.745 24 24 24h304c13.255 0 24-10.745 24-24zm-176 64c-30.928 0-56 25.072-56 56s25.072 56 56 56 56-25.072 56-56-25.072-56-56-56z" class=""></path>
					</svg>
					<div>
					 <div class="h5">From <strong>Ostiense train station:</strong></div>
					 Metro line B to Rebibbia until Termini, metro line A direction Battistini, get off at Ottaviano, take the bus n.32 until Piazzale della Farnesina.
					</div>
				   </div>
				   <div class="mb-4 d-flex align-items-baseline">
					<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="train" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="mr-2 text-muted svg-inline--fa fa-train fa-w-14">
					 <path fill="currentColor" d="M448 96v256c0 51.815-61.624 96-130.022 96l62.98 49.721C386.905 502.417 383.562 512 376 512H72c-7.578 0-10.892-9.594-4.957-14.279L130.022 448C61.82 448 0 403.954 0 352V96C0 42.981 64 0 128 0h192c65 0 128 42.981 128 96zm-48 136V120c0-13.255-10.745-24-24-24H72c-13.255 0-24 10.745-24 24v112c0 13.255 10.745 24 24 24h304c13.255 0 24-10.745 24-24zm-176 64c-30.928 0-56 25.072-56 56s25.072 56 56 56 56-25.072 56-56-25.072-56-56-56z" class=""></path>
					</svg>
					<div>
					 <div class="h5">From <strong>Fiumicino, Leonardo Da Vinci airport:</strong></div>
					 Take the train to Termini, Ostiense, Tiburtina and follow the previous instructions / By car, take the Fiumicino motorway and follow the previous instructions.
					</div>
				   </div>
				   <div class="mb-4 d-flex align-items-baseline">
					<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="train" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="mr-2 text-muted svg-inline--fa fa-train fa-w-14">
					 <path fill="currentColor" d="M448 96v256c0 51.815-61.624 96-130.022 96l62.98 49.721C386.905 502.417 383.562 512 376 512H72c-7.578 0-10.892-9.594-4.957-14.279L130.022 448C61.82 448 0 403.954 0 352V96C0 42.981 64 0 128 0h192c65 0 128 42.981 128 96zm-48 136V120c0-13.255-10.745-24-24-24H72c-13.255 0-24 10.745-24 24v112c0 13.255 10.745 24 24 24h304c13.255 0 24-10.745 24-24zm-176 64c-30.928 0-56 25.072-56 56s25.072 56 56 56 56-25.072 56-56-25.072-56-56-56z" class=""></path>
					</svg>
					<div>
					 <div class="h5"><strong>These Bus have stops at Stadio Olimpico:</strong></div>
					 Bus: <em>168</em>, <em>280</em>, <em>301</em>, <em>32</em>, <em>628</em>, <em>69</em> - Head to the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.atac.roma.it/en/home" target="_blank">ATAC Website</a>&nbsp;for more information.
					</div>
				   </div>
				   <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=stadio+olimpico+roma&amp;travelmode=transit" rel="noopener" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm">See public transport options from your location</a>
				</div>
			   </div>
			   <div role="tabpanel" aria-hidden="true" class="tab-pane fade card-body" id="__BVID__248" aria-labelledby="__BVID__248___BV_tab_button__" style="display: none;">
				<div class="text-left">
				   <div class="d-md-none h5 mb-3">By plane</div>
				   <div class="mb-4 d-flex align-items-baseline">
					<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="plane" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512" class="mr-2 text-muted svg-inline--fa fa-plane fa-w-18">
					 <path fill="currentColor" d="M480 192H365.71L260.61 8.06A16.014 16.014 0 0 0 246.71 0h-65.5c-10.63 0-18.3 10.17-15.38 20.39L214.86 192H112l-43.2-57.6c-3.02-4.03-7.77-6.4-12.8-6.4H16.01C5.6 128-2.04 137.78.49 147.88L32 256 .49 364.12C-2.04 374.22 5.6 384 16.01 384H56c5.04 0 9.78-2.37 12.8-6.4L112 320h102.86l-49.03 171.6c-2.92 10.22 4.75 20.4 15.38 20.4h65.5c5.74 0 11.04-3.08 13.89-8.06L365.71 320H480c35.35 0 96-28.65 96-64s-60.65-64-96-64z" class=""></path>
					</svg>
					<div>
					 <div class="h5">From <strong>Fiumicino, Leonardo Da Vinci airport:</strong></div>
					 Go to Fiumicino station and take the train to Roma Ostiense, Roma Tiburtina or Roma Termini. From any of the above stations, you can take the <strong>Metro A</strong> and follow the instructions available at the “by public trasport” section;<br>If you have a car, you can instead take the <strong>Fiumicino-Rome</strong> motorway to the G.R.A (Rome's ring road) and follow the instructions listed in the ”By car” section;
					</div>
				   </div>
				   <div class="mb-4 d-flex align-items-baseline">
					<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="plane" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 576 512" class="mr-2 text-muted svg-inline--fa fa-plane fa-w-18">
					 <path fill="currentColor" d="M480 192H365.71L260.61 8.06A16.014 16.014 0 0 0 246.71 0h-65.5c-10.63 0-18.3 10.17-15.38 20.39L214.86 192H112l-43.2-57.6c-3.02-4.03-7.77-6.4-12.8-6.4H16.01C5.6 128-2.04 137.78.49 147.88L32 256 .49 364.12C-2.04 374.22 5.6 384 16.01 384H56c5.04 0 9.78-2.37 12.8-6.4L112 320h102.86l-49.03 171.6c-2.92 10.22 4.75 20.4 15.38 20.4h65.5c5.74 0 11.04-3.08 13.89-8.06L365.71 320H480c35.35 0 96-28.65 96-64s-60.65-64-96-64z" class=""></path>
					</svg>
					<div>
					 <div class="h5">From <strong>Ciampino, G. B. Pastine airport:</strong></div>
					 Go to the ciampino airport and take any bus to <strong>Termini or Anagnina station,</strong> so you can catch the <strong>Metro A</strong> and then follow the instructions on ”by public transport” section;<br>If you have a car, you can instead take <strong>Via Appia Nuova</strong> to reach the G.R.A (Rome's ring road) towards Flaminia, take the exit <strong>n.5 (Flaminia).</strong> Follow the indications for the stadium <strong>(Foro Italico)</strong> and follow the instructions listed in the ”By car”section;
					</div>
				   </div>
				</div>
			   </div>
			   <div role="tabpanel" aria-hidden="true" class="tab-pane fade card-body" id="__BVID__250" aria-labelledby="__BVID__250___BV_tab_button__" style="display: none;">
				<div class="text-left">
				   <div class="d-md-none h5 mb-3">By taxi</div>
				   <div class="h5 mb-4">Several taxi drop-off/pick-up points are in proximity to the stadium.</div>
				   <div class="mb-4 d-flex align-items-baseline">
					<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="taxi" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" class="mr-2 text-muted svg-inline--fa fa-taxi fa-w-16">
					 <path fill="currentColor" d="M462 241.64l-22-84.84c-9.6-35.2-41.6-60.8-76.8-60.8H352V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32H192c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32h-11.2c-35.2 0-67.2 25.6-76.8 60.8l-22 84.84C21.41 248.04 0 273.47 0 304v48c0 23.63 12.95 44.04 32 55.12V448c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32h256v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-40.88c19.05-11.09 32-31.5 32-55.12v-48c0-30.53-21.41-55.96-50-62.36zM96 352c-17.67 0-32-14.33-32-32s14.33-32 32-32 32 14.33 32 32-14.33 32-32 32zm20.55-112l17.2-66.36c2.23-8.16 9.59-13.64 15.06-13.64h214.4c5.47 0 12.83 5.48 14.85 12.86L395.45 240h-278.9zM416 352c-17.67 0-32-14.33-32-32s14.33-32 32-32 32 14.33 32 32-14.33 32-32 32z" class=""></path>
					</svg>
					<div>If you have a ticket for the entrances <strong>De Bosis or Dodi,</strong> ask the driver to drop you off at <strong>Piazzale Maresciallo Diaz.</strong></div>
				   </div>
				   <div class="mb-4 d-flex align-items-baseline">
					<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="taxi" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" class="mr-2 text-muted svg-inline--fa fa-taxi fa-w-16">
					 <path fill="currentColor" d="M462 241.64l-22-84.84c-9.6-35.2-41.6-60.8-76.8-60.8H352V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32H192c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32h-11.2c-35.2 0-67.2 25.6-76.8 60.8l-22 84.84C21.41 248.04 0 273.47 0 304v48c0 23.63 12.95 44.04 32 55.12V448c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32h256v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-40.88c19.05-11.09 32-31.5 32-55.12v-48c0-30.53-21.41-55.96-50-62.36zM96 352c-17.67 0-32-14.33-32-32s14.33-32 32-32 32 14.33 32 32-14.33 32-32 32zm20.55-112l17.2-66.36c2.23-8.16 9.59-13.64 15.06-13.64h214.4c5.47 0 12.83 5.48 14.85 12.86L395.45 240h-278.9zM416 352c-17.67 0-32-14.33-32-32s14.33-32 32-32 32 14.33 32 32-14.33 32-32 32z" class=""></path>
					</svg>
					<div>If you have a ticket for the entrances <strong>Gladiatori or Olimpiadi,</strong> ask the driver to drop you off at <strong>Piazzale Maresciallo Giardino.</strong></div>
				   </div>
				   <div class="mb-4 d-flex align-items-baseline">
					<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="taxi" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" class="mr-2 text-muted svg-inline--fa fa-taxi fa-w-16">
					 <path fill="currentColor" d="M462 241.64l-22-84.84c-9.6-35.2-41.6-60.8-76.8-60.8H352V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32H192c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32h-11.2c-35.2 0-67.2 25.6-76.8 60.8l-22 84.84C21.41 248.04 0 273.47 0 304v48c0 23.63 12.95 44.04 32 55.12V448c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32h256v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-40.88c19.05-11.09 32-31.5 32-55.12v-48c0-30.53-21.41-55.96-50-62.36zM96 352c-17.67 0-32-14.33-32-32s14.33-32 32-32 32 14.33 32 32-14.33 32-32 32zm20.55-112l17.2-66.36c2.23-8.16 9.59-13.64 15.06-13.64h214.4c5.47 0 12.83 5.48 14.85 12.86L395.45 240h-278.9zM416 352c-17.67 0-32-14.33-32-32s14.33-32 32-32 32 14.33 32 32-14.33 32-32 32z" class=""></path>
					</svg>
					<div>If the guest prefers, another good option for the drop off/pick up is nearby <strong>Piazza Gentile da Fabriano,</strong> which is about 500 meters from the Stadio Olimpico, passing through <strong>Ponte Della Musica.</strong></div>
				   </div>
				</div>
			   </div>
			   <div role="tabpanel" aria-hidden="true" class="tab-pane fade card-body" id="__BVID__2420" aria-labelledby="__BVID__2420___BV_tab_button__" style="display: none;">
				   <div class="text-left">
					  <div class="d-md-none h5 mb-3">By bike</div>
					  <p>If you wish to reach the Olympic Stadium by bike, several parking spaces are available near the facility, subject to availability.</p>
					  <p>You can park your bicycle at:</p>
					  <ul>
					  	<li><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/qDzdyU7aMzAZ4TcD6" target="_blank">Via Leopoldo Franchetti</a></li>
					    <li><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/1Mu1mMRiMqijr6hk9" target="_blank">Stadio dei Marmi</a></li>
					  </ul>
					  <p>Both areas are located a short distance from the main entrances.</p>
				  </div>
			   <div role="tabpanel" aria-hidden="true" class="tab-pane fade card-body" id="__BVID__252" aria-labelledby="__BVID__252___BV_tab_button__" style="display: none;">
				<div class="text-left">
				   <div class="d-md-none h5 mb-3">Parking</div>
				   <p>The parking areas surrounding the Stadio Olimpico are <strong>reserved</strong> for pass holders.<br>We advise you to park your car in a more distant point, these are some of the recommended areas:</p>
				   <div class="mb-2 d-flex align-items-baseline">
					<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="parking" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="mr-2 text-muted svg-inline--fa fa-parking fa-w-14">
					 <path fill="currentColor" d="M400 32H48C21.5 32 0 53.5 0 80v352c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h352c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48V80c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48zM240 320h-48v48c0 8.8-7.2 16-16 16h-32c-8.8 0-16-7.2-16-16V144c0-8.8 7.2-16 16-16h96c52.9 0 96 43.1 96 96s-43.1 96-96 96zm0-128h-48v64h48c17.6 0 32-14.4 32-32s-14.4-32-32-32z" class=""></path>
					</svg>
					<div>Piazzale Clodio for <strong>Gladiatori or Olimpiadi</strong> entrances;</div>
				   </div>
				   <div class="mb-2 d-flex align-items-baseline">
					<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="parking" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="mr-2 text-muted svg-inline--fa fa-parking fa-w-14">
					 <path fill="currentColor" d="M400 32H48C21.5 32 0 53.5 0 80v352c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h352c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48V80c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48zM240 320h-48v48c0 8.8-7.2 16-16 16h-32c-8.8 0-16-7.2-16-16V144c0-8.8 7.2-16 16-16h96c52.9 0 96 43.1 96 96s-43.1 96-96 96zm0-128h-48v64h48c17.6 0 32-14.4 32-32s-14.4-32-32-32z" class=""></path>
					</svg>
					<div>Viale XVII Olimpiade (Flaminia/Auditorium area);</div>
				   </div>
				   <div class="mb-4 d-flex align-items-baseline">
					<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="parking" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="mr-2 text-muted svg-inline--fa fa-parking fa-w-14">
					 <path fill="currentColor" d="M400 32H48C21.5 32 0 53.5 0 80v352c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h352c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48V80c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48zM240 320h-48v48c0 8.8-7.2 16-16 16h-32c-8.8 0-16-7.2-16-16V144c0-8.8 7.2-16 16-16h96c52.9 0 96 43.1 96 96s-43.1 96-96 96zm0-128h-48v64h48c17.6 0 32-14.4 32-32s-14.4-32-32-32z" class=""></path>
					</svg>
					<div>Viale Tor di Quinto, height of the Salvo D'Acquisto barracks for the <strong>De Bosis or Dodi</strong> entrances;</div>
				   </div>
				   <p><strong>Types of parking areas for people with disabilities:</strong></p>
				   <ul>
						<li class="mb-2">
							<strong>Tribuna Tevere (people with non-ambulatory disabilities):</strong><br />
							Spectators with a valid permit and in possession of a season ticket/Tribuna Tevere Disabili (rate for a non-ambulatory person with a disability + companion) can park at the Stadio dei Marmi. Spaces are limited and available until sold out.
						</li>
						<li class="mb-2">
							<strong>Tribuna Monte Mario (people with non-ambulatory disabilities):</strong><br />
							Spectators with a valid permit and in possession of a season ticket/Tribuna Monte Mario Disabili (rate for a non-ambulatory person with a disability + companion) can park at Viale dei Gladiatori. Spaces are limited and available until sold out.
						</li>
						<li>
							<strong>Other types of disabilities:</strong><br />
							Parking is available for spectators with various disabilities on Viale Alberto Blanc. Additionally, further reserved spaces will be available at the Stadio dei Marmi and on Viale dei Gladiatori. Spaces are limited and available on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>
						</li>
				   </ul>
				</div>
			   </div>
			   <!---->
			  </div>
			 </div>
			 <!----><!---->
		  </div>
		 </div>
		</div>
	   </div>
	</div>
</div><div class="fr-embedded">
 <div data-v-dfeae886="" class="fw-block py-5 text-center bg--white">
    <div data-v-dfeae886="" class="container">
    <div data-v-dfeae886="" class="row">
      <div data-v-dfeae886="" class="d-flex flex-column col-lg-4"><svg data-v-dfeae886="" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="file-contract" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 384 512"
        class="text-primary mb-3 mx-auto svg-inline--fa fa-file-contract fa-w-12 fa-2x">
        <path data-v-dfeae886="" fill="currentColor"
        d="M224 136V0H24C10.7 0 0 10.7 0 24v464c0 13.3 10.7 24 24 24h336c13.3 0 24-10.7 24-24V160H248c-13.2 0-24-10.8-24-24zM64 72c0-4.42 3.58-8 8-8h80c4.42 0 8 3.58 8 8v16c0 4.42-3.58 8-8 8H72c-4.42 0-8-3.58-8-8V72zm0 64c0-4.42 3.58-8 8-8h80c4.42 0 8 3.58 8 8v16c0 4.42-3.58 8-8 8H72c-4.42 0-8-3.58-8-8v-16zm192.81 248H304c8.84 0 16 7.16 16 16s-7.16 16-16 16h-47.19c-16.45 0-31.27-9.14-38.64-23.86-2.95-5.92-8.09-6.52-10.17-6.52s-7.22.59-10.02 6.19l-7.67 15.34a15.986 15.986 0 0 1-14.31 8.84c-.38 0-.75-.02-1.14-.05-6.45-.45-12-4.75-14.03-10.89L144 354.59l-10.61 31.88c-5.89 17.66-22.38 29.53-41 29.53H80c-8.84 0-16-7.16-16-16s7.16-16 16-16h12.39c4.83 0 9.11-3.08 10.64-7.66l18.19-54.64c3.3-9.81 12.44-16.41 22.78-16.41s19.48 6.59 22.77 16.41l13.88 41.64c19.77-16.19 54.05-9.7 66 14.16 2.02 4.06 5.96 6.5 10.16 6.5zM377 105L279.1 7c-4.5-4.5-10.6-7-17-7H256v128h128v-6.1c0-6.3-2.5-12.4-7-16.9z"
        class=""></path>
      </svg>
      <h2 data-v-dfeae886="" class="h4 font-weight-bold mb-4">Stadio Olimpico regulations</h2>
      <p data-v-dfeae886="">The entrance and permanence, for any reason, inside the stadium is governed by the “Rules and Regulations”; The purchase of a ticket by any individual entails the acceptance of the below mentioned regulations.</p>
      <p data-v-dfeae886="" class="mt-auto"><a data-v-dfeae886="" href="/en/stadium/rules" class="d-flex-inline align-items-center"><span data-v-dfeae886="">Read now</span><svg data-v-dfeae886=""
          aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="chevron-right" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512" class="ml-1 svg-inline--fa fa-chevron-right fa-w-10 fa-xs">
          <path data-v-dfeae886="" fill="currentColor"
          d="M285.476 272.971L91.132 467.314c-9.373 9.373-24.569 9.373-33.941 0l-22.667-22.667c-9.357-9.357-9.375-24.522-.04-33.901L188.505 256 34.484 101.255c-9.335-9.379-9.317-24.544.04-33.901l22.667-22.667c9.373-9.373 24.569-9.373 33.941 0L285.475 239.03c9.373 9.372 9.373 24.568.001 33.941z"
          class=""></path>
        </svg></a></p>
      </div>
      <div data-v-dfeae886="" class="d-flex flex-column col-lg-4"><svg data-v-dfeae886="" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="thumbs-up" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512"
        class="text-primary mb-3 mx-auto svg-inline--fa fa-thumbs-up fa-w-16 fa-2x">
        <path data-v-dfeae886="" fill="currentColor"
        d="M104 224H24c-13.255 0-24 10.745-24 24v240c0 13.255 10.745 24 24 24h80c13.255 0 24-10.745 24-24V248c0-13.255-10.745-24-24-24zM64 472c-13.255 0-24-10.745-24-24s10.745-24 24-24 24 10.745 24 24-10.745 24-24 24zM384 81.452c0 42.416-25.97 66.208-33.277 94.548h101.723c33.397 0 59.397 27.746 59.553 58.098.084 17.938-7.546 37.249-19.439 49.197l-.11.11c9.836 23.337 8.237 56.037-9.308 79.469 8.681 25.895-.069 57.704-16.382 74.757 4.298 17.598 2.244 32.575-6.148 44.632C440.202 511.587 389.616 512 346.839 512l-2.845-.001c-48.287-.017-87.806-17.598-119.56-31.725-15.957-7.099-36.821-15.887-52.651-16.178-6.54-.12-11.783-5.457-11.783-11.998v-213.77c0-3.2 1.282-6.271 3.558-8.521 39.614-39.144 56.648-80.587 89.117-113.111 14.804-14.832 20.188-37.236 25.393-58.902C282.515 39.293 291.817 0 312 0c24 0 72 8 72 81.452z"
        class=""></path>
      </svg>
      <h2 data-v-dfeae886="" class="h4 font-weight-bold mb-4">Roma fans' code of conduct</h2>
      <p data-v-dfeae886="">Using the Code of Conduct, which is integrated with the Stadio Olimpico Regulation on Use, the Club intends to share with its supporters and all other participants, including opponents’ fans the ethical and
        behavioral principles to which primary value.</p>
      <p data-v-dfeae886="" class="mt-auto"><a data-v-dfeae886="" rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://media.asroma.com/prod/files/file/gm-8b120aca-2d6f-42c5-a05e-0dc1d92b0852-codeofconducten.pdf"
        class="d-flex-inline align-items-center"><span data-v-dfeae886="">Read now</span><svg data-v-dfeae886="" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="chevron-right" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          viewBox="0 0 320 512" class="ml-1 svg-inline--fa fa-chevron-right fa-w-10 fa-xs">
          <path data-v-dfeae886="" fill="currentColor"
          d="M285.476 272.971L91.132 467.314c-9.373 9.373-24.569 9.373-33.941 0l-22.667-22.667c-9.357-9.357-9.375-24.522-.04-33.901L188.505 256 34.484 101.255c-9.335-9.379-9.317-24.544.04-33.901l22.667-22.667c9.373-9.373 24.569-9.373 33.941 0L285.475 239.03c9.373 9.372 9.373 24.568.001 33.941z"
          class=""></path>
        </svg></a></p>
      </div>
      <div data-v-dfeae886="" class="d-flex flex-column col-lg-4"><svg data-v-dfeae886="" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="flag" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512"
        class="text-primary mb-3 mx-auto svg-inline--fa fa-flag fa-w-16 fa-2x">
        <path data-v-dfeae886="" fill="currentColor"
        d="M349.565 98.783C295.978 98.783 251.721 64 184.348 64c-24.955 0-47.309 4.384-68.045 12.013a55.947 55.947 0 0 0 3.586-23.562C118.117 24.015 94.806 1.206 66.338.048 34.345-1.254 8 24.296 8 56c0 19.026 9.497 35.825 24 45.945V488c0 13.255 10.745 24 24 24h16c13.255 0 24-10.745 24-24v-94.4c28.311-12.064 63.582-22.122 114.435-22.122 53.588 0 97.844 34.783 165.217 34.783 48.169 0 86.667-16.294 122.505-40.858C506.84 359.452 512 349.571 512 339.045v-243.1c0-23.393-24.269-38.87-45.485-29.016-34.338 15.948-76.454 31.854-116.95 31.854z"
        class=""></path>
      </svg>
      <h2 data-v-dfeae886="" class="h4 font-weight-bold mb-4">Request form for the authorization of banners and/or choreographies</h2>
      <p data-v-dfeae886="">AS Roma informs that in order to place a banner, access with megaphone, with a drum or to perform a choreography at the Olympic Stadium, it is necessary to be in possession of an authorization from the AS Roma
        Company and approved by the GOS. This authorization must be requested at the email address <a href="mailto:slo@asroma.it">slo@asroma.it</a> , within 7 working days prior to the event. The request must be accompanied by the user data
        and a copy of the following document (Italian only).</p>
      <p data-v-dfeae886="" class="mt-auto"><a data-v-dfeae886="" rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://media.asroma.com/prod/files/file/gm-85dc6e8b-939a-4d1b-adb6-e54072a1398c-richiestaautorizzazione-1.pdf"
        class="d-flex-inline align-items-center"><span data-v-dfeae886="">Download now</span><svg data-v-dfeae886="" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="chevron-right" role="img"
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512" class="ml-1 svg-inline--fa fa-chevron-right fa-w-10 fa-xs">
          <path data-v-dfeae886="" fill="currentColor"
          d="M285.476 272.971L91.132 467.314c-9.373 9.373-24.569 9.373-33.941 0l-22.667-22.667c-9.357-9.357-9.375-24.522-.04-33.901L188.505 256 34.484 101.255c-9.335-9.379-9.317-24.544.04-33.901l22.667-22.667c9.373-9.373 24.569-9.373 33.941 0L285.475 239.03c9.373 9.372 9.373 24.568.001 33.941z"
          class=""></path>
        </svg></a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div>
