 <div class="ticket-faqs gd-frame" id="roma-faq">

  <div class="asr-main-content asr-main-content-faq">

    <!-- if we DONT have tabs in article body -->
    <!-- FAQ Layout for /tickets/conifigc page !-->
    <div class="asr-faqs-main-title__conifigc">
      FAQ
    </div>
    <div class="asr__tickets-conifigc-faq">
      <div class="asr-details-accordion" 
onkeydown="toggleAccordionEnter(event)"
onclick="toggleAccordion(event)">
  <div role="button" class="asr-details-accordion_title" tabindex="0">How do I visit the Stadium? <span>+</span></div>
  <div class="asr-details-accordion_content" >
    <div class="gc-col-12 gd-cp-column" data-gid="eU9i-ZH31O01">
 <div data-gid="egrbde8rXWWF"> 
  <p data-gid="eSQYDxzoorO" id="edgu3DpKfkH">To find out how to get to the Stadio Olimpico visit our website 
<a class="pros-embed-body__link" rel="noopener" href="https://www.asroma.com/stadium/" >https://www.asroma.com/stadium</a></p> 
  <p data-gid="epRUx-c9JEl" id="eYVlgkP9Po6">Fans are able to reach the Stadio Olimpico using scooter or car sharing services. Alternatively, go to &nbsp;
<a class="pros-embed-body__link" rel="noopener" href="https://viaggiacon.atac.roma.it/" >https://viaggiacon.atac.roma.it/</a> to find out how to get to the stadium by public transport.</p> 
  <p data-gid="e8XsMQo6jAf" id="ef216MFLaZx">
<a class="pros-embed-body__link" rel="noopener" href="https://romevacationtips.com/how-to-watch-a-match-at-romes-olympic-stadium/" target="_blank">More information about visiting the Stadio Olimpico in Rome</a>.&nbsp;</p> 
 </div>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

      <div class="asr-details-accordion" 
onkeydown="toggleAccordionEnter(event)"
onclick="toggleAccordion(event)">
  <div role="button" class="asr-details-accordion_title" tabindex="0">What time can I enter the stadium? <span>+</span></div>
  <div class="asr-details-accordion_content" >
    <div class="gc-col-12 gd-cp-column" data-gid="eW_BQv5MPR8b">
 <p data-gid="enD3eZW2_S_v" id="eu7FJlI-fTEM">It is strongly recommended that fans enter the stadium at the time indicated on their ticket in order to avoid overcrowding.</p>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

      <div class="asr-details-accordion" 
onkeydown="toggleAccordionEnter(event)"
onclick="toggleAccordion(event)">
  <div role="button" class="asr-details-accordion_title" tabindex="0">What do I need to enter the stadium? <span>+</span></div>
  <div class="asr-details-accordion_content" >
    <div class="gc-col-12 gd-cp-column" data-gid="eBAxzUbYb-60">
 <p data-gid="e8Za_sYY07EW" id="eVWPW3hB7tCF">In order to enter the stadium you need a valid match ticket and a valid identity document. There is no need to print digital tickets.</p>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

      <div class="asr-details-accordion" 
onkeydown="toggleAccordionEnter(event)"
onclick="toggleAccordion(event)">
  <div role="button" class="asr-details-accordion_title" tabindex="0">Are there any rules to follow for stadium access? <span>+</span></div>
  <div class="asr-details-accordion_content" >
    <div class="gc-col-12 gd-cp-column" data-gid="eHc-TQCgI3Cl">
 <p data-gid="eJDUjdcJ1pqD" id="enAt41trVw3t">To check the code of conduct and access rules visit the following link: 
<a class="pros-embed-body__link" rel="noopener" href="https://www.asroma.com/en/stadium/rules" >https://www.asroma.com/en/stadium/rules</a>.</p>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

      <div class="asr-details-accordion" 
onkeydown="toggleAccordionEnter(event)"
onclick="toggleAccordion(event)">
  <div role="button" class="asr-details-accordion_title" tabindex="0">Can I take a suitcase into the stadium? <span>+</span></div>
  <div class="asr-details-accordion_content" >
    <div class="gc-col-12 gd-cp-column" data-gid="e6KiKuxFT5Eq">
 <p data-gid="ejOoT1L01f2h" id="eMCfz0AOYNUm">Luggage is not permitted in the Stadio Olimpico.</p>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

      <div class="asr-details-accordion" 
onkeydown="toggleAccordionEnter(event)"
onclick="toggleAccordion(event)">
  <div role="button" class="asr-details-accordion_title" tabindex="0">Can I bring a power bank? <span>+</span></div>
  <div class="asr-details-accordion_content" >
    <div class="gc-col-12 gd-cp-column" data-gid="eqQd7Hw1ZeVy">
 <p data-gid="etQfe6RAtz8C" id="ehkcwniBwbBy">Power banks are not permitted in the Stadio Olimpico.</p>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

      <div class="asr-details-accordion" 
onkeydown="toggleAccordionEnter(event)"
onclick="toggleAccordion(event)">
  <div role="button" class="asr-details-accordion_title" tabindex="0">Can I bring an e-cigarette?  <span>+</span></div>
  <div class="asr-details-accordion_content" >
    <div class="gc-col-12 gd-cp-column" data-gid="er707NoM8F_Z">
 <p data-gid="eaTfbdYYndEe" id="ePkz-aRDwHTQ">E-cigarettes are not permitted in the Stadio Olimpico.</p>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

      <div class="asr-details-accordion" 
onkeydown="toggleAccordionEnter(event)"
onclick="toggleAccordion(event)">
  <div role="button" class="asr-details-accordion_title" tabindex="0">Can I bring a lighter? <span>+</span></div>
  <div class="asr-details-accordion_content" >
    <div class="gc-col-12 gd-cp-column" data-gid="eUvjo342bcFi">
 <p data-gid="eLOHXgsUMAVq" id="eETKnWZmVQUq">Lighters are not permitted in the Stadio Olimpico.</p>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

      <div class="asr-details-accordion" 
onkeydown="toggleAccordionEnter(event)"
onclick="toggleAccordion(event)">
  <div role="button" class="asr-details-accordion_title" tabindex="0">Can I bring a helmet? <span>+</span></div>
  <div class="asr-details-accordion_content" >
    <div class="gc-col-12 gd-cp-column" data-gid="eiJnGbm01Kz2">
 <p data-gid="ezSwu4-d1PRc" id="eRpih0dp6-su">Helmets are not permitted in the Stadio Olimpico.</p>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

      <div class="asr-details-accordion" 
onkeydown="toggleAccordionEnter(event)"
onclick="toggleAccordion(event)">
  <div role="button" class="asr-details-accordion_title" tabindex="0">Can I bring scooter/car/house keys? <span>+</span></div>
  <div class="asr-details-accordion_content" >
    <div class="gc-col-12 gd-cp-column" data-gid="eWtO56fEqE3O">
 <p data-gid="eVnkT9yWwQ3c" id="efK6VCwSPmdl">Yes, such keys are permitted in the Stadio Olimpico.</p>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

      <div class="asr-details-accordion" 
onkeydown="toggleAccordionEnter(event)"
onclick="toggleAccordion(event)">
  <div role="button" class="asr-details-accordion_title" tabindex="0">Am I able to leave my luggage somewhere in the stadium? <span>+</span></div>
  <div class="asr-details-accordion_content" >
    <div class="gc-col-12 gd-cp-column" data-gid="eqiwZAUJpKth">
 <p data-gid="eKlhe1BVg75p" id="euWcf4iwYpTP">There is nowhere to leave luggage in the Stadio Olimpico.</p>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

      <div class="asr-details-accordion" 
onkeydown="toggleAccordionEnter(event)"
onclick="toggleAccordion(event)">
  <div role="button" class="asr-details-accordion_title" tabindex="0">Can I bring a camera? <span>+</span></div>
  <div class="asr-details-accordion_content" >
    <div class="gc-col-12 gd-cp-column" data-gid="en460TArm23P">
 <p data-gid="eUS8UNgTqNDy" id="eaC4XBnyKLTb">Only non-professional cameras are permitted.</p>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

      <div class="asr-details-accordion" 
onkeydown="toggleAccordionEnter(event)"
onclick="toggleAccordion(event)">
  <div role="button" class="asr-details-accordion_title" tabindex="0">Can I bring a pushchair? <span>+</span></div>
  <div class="asr-details-accordion_content" >
    <div class="gc-col-12 gd-cp-column" data-gid="ezIaAAC0aELT">
 <p data-gid="e-2W0sbzSO6T" id="eTprwjKmGkWH">Pushchairs are not permitted in the Stadio Olimpico.</p>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

      <div class="asr-details-accordion" 
onkeydown="toggleAccordionEnter(event)"
onclick="toggleAccordion(event)">
  <div role="button" class="asr-details-accordion_title" tabindex="0">Can I bring an umbrella? <span>+</span></div>
  <div class="asr-details-accordion_content" >
    <div class="gc-col-12 gd-cp-column" data-gid="exRYM75na7p9">
 <p data-gid="ekEyoojUna8J" id="eErf48TErQMO">Yes. Umbrellas are permitted in the Stadio Olimpico but they must not have a pointed end.</p>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

      <div class="asr-details-accordion" 
onkeydown="toggleAccordionEnter(event)"
onclick="toggleAccordion(event)">
  <div role="button" class="asr-details-accordion_title" tabindex="0">Can I bring crutches? <span>+</span></div>
  <div class="asr-details-accordion_content" >
    <div class="gc-col-12 gd-cp-column" data-gid="etXforK9TMlP">
 <p data-gid="eVWl2ZA0hlzG" id="eOF_6oXiEv4j">Crutches are permitted in the Stadio Olimpico as long as the user presents a medical certificate.</p>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

      <div class="asr-details-accordion" 
onkeydown="toggleAccordionEnter(event)"
onclick="toggleAccordion(event)">
  <div role="button" class="asr-details-accordion_title" tabindex="0">Can I bring food and drink? <span>+</span></div>
  <div class="asr-details-accordion_content" >
    <div class="gc-col-12 gd-cp-column" data-gid="eX8FnA89YmCd">
 <p data-gid="eSSy9YS9XezQ" id="ertOgy3r_DQS">Food items such as sandwiches and pizza are permitted but drinks in bottles or other containers are not.</p>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

      <div class="asr-details-accordion" 
onkeydown="toggleAccordionEnter(event)"
onclick="toggleAccordion(event)">
  <div role="button" class="asr-details-accordion_title" tabindex="0">How can I take part in a guided tour of the stadium? <span>+</span></div>
  <div class="asr-details-accordion_content" >
    <div class="gc-col-12 gd-cp-column" data-gid="eO-YF8mLukmm">
 <p data-gid="eKoWK3WhkmEj" id="eNuwDwBx-Cq_">For information on the tour of the Stadio Olimpico visit the following website: &nbsp;
<a class="pros-embed-body__link" rel="noopener" href="https://www.sportesalute.eu/en/stadio-olimpico-tour.html" >https://www.sportesalute.eu/en/stadio-olimpico-tour.html</a>.</p>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

      <div class="asr-details-accordion" 
onkeydown="toggleAccordionEnter(event)"
onclick="toggleAccordion(event)">
  <div role="button" class="asr-details-accordion_title" tabindex="0">Can I purchase club merchandise at the Stadio Olimpico on matchdays? <span>+</span></div>
  <div class="asr-details-accordion_content" >
    <div class="gc-col-12 gd-cp-column" data-gid="e9NKV_FG5Llq">
 <p data-gid="e8N0c-HEyHNc" id="ey6ZDW2YcP0O">Yes. There is a Roma Store inside the Foro Italico sports complex.</p>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

      <div class="asr-details-accordion" 
onkeydown="toggleAccordionEnter(event)"
onclick="toggleAccordion(event)">
  <div role="button" class="asr-details-accordion_title" tabindex="0">Where can I park around the Stadio Olimpico? <span>+</span></div>
  <div class="asr-details-accordion_content" >
    <div class="gc-col-12 gd-cp-column" data-gid="eI0921-3zOca">
 <p data-gid="eImwuRkgzKsu" id="euLmHJRs1yAF">There are spaces marked with white stripes (free) and blue stripes (paid) around the Foro Italico.</p>
</div>
  </div>
</div>

